  "_stations_doc": "v8: per-city resolution-station overrides. Polymarket weather markets resolve at a specific weather station (e.g. KLGA, HKO, VILK), NOT the city center. Without these coords, the bot pulls forecast for the wrong location, causing systematic 1-3 degrees C miss = losing trade. lat/lon point to the station; station = ICAO/WMO code from the market 'Rules' section; temp_bias_f = optional residual offset (e.g. HK runs cold by ~1F in May per article scar #3). Cities NOT in this dict fall back to OpenWeather geocoding by name (best effort).",
